Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: chord
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-mido, fluidsynth, fluid-soundfont-gm
Description: CLI tool to play musical chords by name
 Type a chord name and hear it played instantly via FluidSynth.
 Supports standard chord notation (Dm7/9, Cmaj7, G7, F#m7b5, etc.),
 Italian tempo markings (--allegro, --adagio, ...), and repeat count.
